#: ../../source/security-guide/hipaa-compliance.rst:2
msgid "HIPAA Compliance"
msgstr "HIPAA 컴플라이언스"

#: ../../source/security-guide/hipaa-compliance.rst:4
msgid ""
"Deploying Mattermost as part of a HIPAA-compliant IT infrastructure "
"requires a deployment team trained on `HIPAA-compliance requirements and "
"standards <https://www.hhs.gov/hipaa/for-professionals/security/laws-"
"regulations/>`_."
msgstr ""
"HIPAA를 준수하는 IT 인프라의 일부로 OKR.BEST를 배포하려면 `HIPAA 컴플라이언스 요구사항 및 "
"표준 <https://www.hhs.gov/hipaa/for-professionals/security/laws-"
"regulations/>`_ 교육을 받은 배포 팀이 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/security-guide/hipaa-compliance.rst:6
msgid "HIPAA-compliant deployments commonly consider the following:"
msgstr "HIPAA 준수 배포에서는 일반적으로 다음 사항을 고려합니다."

#: ../../source/security-guide/hipaa-compliance.rst:8
msgid ""
"Omitting the contents of messages from mobile push and email "
"notifications:"
msgstr ""
"모바일 푸시 및 이메일 알림에서 메시지 내용을 생략합니다."

#: ../../source/security-guide/hipaa-compliance.rst:10
msgid ""
"If your :ref:`Push Notifications Contents <administration-guide/configure"
"/site-configuration-settings:push notification contents>` option is set "
"to ``Send full message snippet`` there is a chance Personal Health "
"Information (PHI) contained in messages could be displayed on a user's "
"locked phone as a notification. To avoid this, set the option to ``Send "
"generic description with user and channel names`` or ``Send generic "
"description with only sender name``."
msgstr ""
":ref:`푸시 알림 내용 <administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings:push "
"notification contents>` 옵션이 ``Send full message snippet``로 설정되어 있으면 메시지에 포함된 "
"개인 건강 정보(PHI)가 사용자의 잠금 화면에 알림으로 표시될 수 있습니다. 이를 방지하려면 옵션을 "
"``Send generic description with user and channel names`` 또는 ``Send generic "
"description with only sender name``로 설정합니다."

#: ../../source/security-guide/hipaa-compliance.rst:11
msgid ""
"Similarly, setting :ref:`Email Notifications Contents <administration-"
"guide/configure/site-configuration-settings:email notification contents>`"
" to ``Send generic description with only sender name`` will only send the"
" team name and name of the person who sent the message, with no "
"information about channel name or message contents included in email "
"notifications."
msgstr ""
"마찬가지로 :ref:`이메일 알림 내용 <administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-"
"settings:email notification contents>`을 ``Send generic description with only sender "
"name``로 설정하면 이메일 알림에는 메시지를 보낸 사람의 이름과 팀 이름만 전송되고, 채널 이름이나 "
"메시지 내용 정보는 포함되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/security-guide/hipaa-compliance.rst:13
msgid "Beyond Technical Safeguards, HIPAA compliance deployments also require:"
msgstr "HIPAA 준수 배포에는 기술적 보호 조치 외에도 다음이 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/security-guide/hipaa-compliance.rst:15
msgid "Administrative Safeguards"
msgstr "관리적 보호 조치"

#: ../../source/security-guide/hipaa-compliance.rst:16
msgid "Physical Safeguards"
msgstr "물리적 보호 조치"

#: ../../source/security-guide/hipaa-compliance.rst:17
msgid "Organizational requirements and other standards."
msgstr "조직 요구사항 및 기타 표준."

#: ../../source/security-guide/hipaa-compliance.rst:19
msgid ""
"To learn more, please review `HIPAA requirements from the US Department "
"of Health and Human Services <https://www.hhs.gov/hipaa/for-"
"professionals/security/laws-regulations/>`_."
msgstr ""
"자세한 내용은 `미국 보건복지부의 HIPAA 요구사항 <https://www.hhs.gov/hipaa/for-"
"professionals/security/laws-regulations/>`_\\ 을 검토하세요."
